      "summaries": {
        "en": "RuView is an open-source Rust project that transforms ordinary WiFi signals into real-time human pose estimation and vital sign monitoring without cameras, addressing privacy concerns in surveillance and healthcare. It leverages WiFi's Channel State Information (CSI) to detect subtle signal variations caused by human movement and breathing, using signal processing and machine learning to reconstruct pose and physiological data. Developers can integrate it into smart home systems for presence detection, experiment with fall detection for elderly care, or extend its algorithms to new sensing applications using commodity WiFi hardware.",
        "zh": "RuView 是一个基于 Rust 的开源项目，通过普通 WiFi 信号实现实时人体姿态估计和生命体征监测，无需摄像头，解决了监控和医疗场景中的隐私问题。其核心技术在于利用 WiFi 信道状态信息（CSI），捕捉人体运动和呼吸引起的细微信号变化，通过信号处理和机器学习算法重建姿态与生理数据。开发者可将它集成到智能家居系统中进行存在检测，尝试用于老年人跌倒监测，或基于现有算法扩展新的感知应用，仅需常规 WiFi 硬件即可实验。",
        "es": "RuView is an open-source Rust project that transforms ordinary WiFi signals into real-time human pose estimation and vital sign monitoring without cameras, addressing privacy concerns in surveillance and healthcare. It leverages WiFi's Channel State Information (CSI) to detect subtle signal variations caused by human movement and breathing, using signal processing and machine learning to reconstruct pose and physiological data. Developers can integrate it into smart home systems for presence detection, experiment with fall detection for elderly care, or extend its algorithms to new sensing applications using commodity WiFi hardware.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "RuView stands out for densepose, densepose-controlnet, and wifi in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "RuView is an open-source Rust project that transforms ordinary WiFi signals into real-time human pose estimation and vital sign monitoring without cameras, addressing privacy concerns in surveillance and healthcare. It leverages WiFi's Channel State Information (CSI) to detect subtle signal variations caused by human movement and breathing, using signal processing and machine learning to reconstruct pose and physiological data. Developers can integrate it into smart home systems for presence detection, experiment with fall detection for elderly care, or extend its algorithms to new sensing applications using commodity WiFi hardware.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/ruvnet/RuView for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
